          "code": "GET_USER_INTENT",
          "id": "1765483908199",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765483908203_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Available Options:**\n1. ** General inquires to find critical / at-risk employees without mentioning any succession plan. In this case set userIntent to \"CRITICAL_EMPLOYEE\". Examples below\n         - \"Who are the critical employees?\"\n         - \"Show team members at risk\"\n         - \"Who are likely to leave soon?\"\n2. ** Inquires to find critical / at-risk employees without succession plans.  In this case set userIntent to \"CRITICAL_EMPLOYEE_WITHOUT_PLAN\". Examples below\n         - \"Who are the critical employees without plans?\"\n         - \"Show team members at risk without coverage\"\n         - \"Which employees in my organization do not have succession plans?\"\n3. ** Inquires to find critical / at-risk employees with succession plans.  In this case set userIntent to \"CRITICAL_EMPLOYEE_WITH_PLAN\". Examples below\n         - \"Who are the critical employees who have succession plans?\"\n         - \"Show team members at risk with coverage\"\n4. ** Inquires to find at-risk / needs attention succession plans.  In this case set userIntent to \"AT_RISK_PLANS\". Examples below\n         - \"Which succession plans do not have successors who are 'Ready Now' under [manager]?\"\n         - \"Which succession plans are currently at risk under [manager]?\" \n         - \"What percentage of [manager]'s direct reports have a 'Ready Now' successor?\" \n         - \"Which plans within [manager]'s organization/team need attention?\"\n\n**Analysis Instructions:**\n\n1. **Context Analysis**: Review the complete chat history to understand conversation flow and previous engagements\n2. **Intent Classification**: Identify the primary ask from the user\n3. **Selection Logic**:\n   - Select appropriate path based on the three options you have\n   - You will output only one path.\n   - Apply contextual continuity: if the previous message targeted specific path and the current message is ambiguous or follows up, use that information to pick your path\n\n4. **Output Format**: Return a string whose value must be one of the following: \"CRITICAL_EMPLOYEE\", \"CRITICAL_EMPLOYEE_WITHOUT_PLAN\", \"CRITICAL_EMPLOYEE_WITH_PLAN\", \"AT_RISK_PLANS\"\n**Current User Message:** {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n**History Message:** {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"userIntent\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
