          "code": "SHOW_ATRISK_SUCCESSION_PLANS",
          "id": "1777273205850",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777273205851_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Role\nYou are the response composer. Your job is to craft a clear, professional, human-friendly answer to the user's current question using ONLY the retrieved data provided below.  Mention only direct reports are searched. \n\n## Current Question \n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n## Retrieved Data\nDirect reports' succession plans and readiness levels and candidate count for each readiness level: {{$context.$nodes.GET_READINESSCANDIDATES_COUNT_FOR_EACH_READINESSLEVEL.$output.result.details}}\nAll Readiness Summary:{{$context.$nodes.GET_READINESSCANDIDATES_COUNT_FOR_EACH_READINESSLEVEL.$output.result.summary}}\n{{$context.$nodes.SUCCESSION_ORGCHART_DEEP_LINK.$output}}\n\n## Conversation History (reference only)\n{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\n### Rule\n- A succession plan is at-risk or needs attention if it's candidate count for readiness level Ready Now is 0.\n- An employee is considered to have a successor of a readiness if at least one of his/her successions plans has candidate count > 0 for that readiness level.\n\n### Formatting\n- Lead with a direct answer. No preambles like \"Based on the data retrieved...\" or \"I am able to answer.\"\n- Do not expose internal identifiers such as PersonId, AssignmentId, PlanId etc, except when it's inside a hyperlink.\n- Add a new line before deep link.\n- The hyperlink must open a new tab instead of same tab in browser.\n- Do NOT show any data that are excluded or not included."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Process All Reports Talent Ratings",
            "sourceType": "code",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const data = $context.$nodes.GET_ALL_REPORTS_TALENT_RATINGS.$output;\nconst results = [];\nconst rol = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_MANAGEMENT_LEVEL_AND_REQUESTED_TALENT_RATINGS.$output.riskOfLoss;\nconst iol = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_MANAGEMENT_LEVEL_AND_REQUESTED_TALENT_RATINGS.$output.impactOfLoss;\nconst jr = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_MANAGEMENT_LEVEL_AND_REQUESTED_TALENT_RATINGS.$output.jobRisk;\nconst perf = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_MANAGEMENT_LEVEL_AND_REQUESTED_TALENT_RATINGS.$output.performance;\nconst pot = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_MANAGEMENT_LEVEL_AND_REQUESTED_TALENT_RATINGS.$output.potential;\nconst showAll = ((rol.length === 0) && (iol.length === 0) && (jr.length === 0) && (perf.length === 0) && (pot.length === 0));\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < data.items.length; i++) {\n\n    var emp = data.items[i];\n    var displayName = emp.DisplayName;\n    var assignmentName = emp.AssignmentName;           \n    var personNumber = emp.PersonNumber;\n    var departmentName = emp.DepartmentName;\n    var locationName = emp.LocationName;\n\n    var allReportsTalentRatings = emp.allReportsTalentRatings.items;\n\n    for (let j = 0; j < allReportsTalentRatings.length; j++) {\n\n        var talentRatings = allReportsTalentRatings[j];\n        var impactOfLoss = talentRatings.ImpactOfLoss ?? \"\";\n        var riskOfLoss = talentRatings.RiskOfLoss ?? \"\";\n        var jobRisk = talentRatings.JobRisk ?? \"\";\n        var performance = talentRatings.Performance ?? \"\";\n        var potential = talentRatings.Potential ?? \"\";\n        var critical_atrisk = (impactOfLoss.toUpperCase() === 'HIGH' || riskOfLoss.toUpperCase() === 'HIGH' || jobRisk.toUpperCase() === 'HIGH');\n        var likelyToLeave = (riskOfLoss.toUpperCase() === 'HIGH');\n\n        if (showAll || rol.includes(riskOfLoss.toUpperCase()) || (iol.includes(impactOfLoss.toUpperCase())) || (jr.includes(jobRisk.toUpperCase())) || (perf.includes(performance.toUpperCase())) || (pot.includes(potential.toUpperCase()))) {\n            results.push({\n                DisplayName: displayName,\n                BusinessTitle: assignmentName,\n                PersonNumber: personNumber,\n                DepartmentName: departmentName,\n                LocationName: locationName,\n                ImpactOfLoss: impactOfLoss,\n                RiskOfLoss: riskOfLoss,\n                JobRisk: jobRisk,\n                Performance: performance,\n                Potential: potential,\n                Critical_AtRisk: critical_atrisk,\n                LikelyToLeave: likelyToLeave\n            });\n        }\n    }\n}\nreturn results;"
          },
